==Description==
To use this template, copy the following code and fill in the appropriate fields.

==Syntax==
<pre>
{{infobox location
 | title         = 
 | image         = [e.g. "Example.jpg"]
 | imagecaption  = 
 | map           = [e.g. "Example.jpg"]
 | mapcaption    = 
 | type          = 
 | level         = 
 | location      = 
 | inhabitants   = 
}}
</pre>

